    "One new36-case file; all1050 parent sources, product and previous tests preserved. No baseline comparison claimed for this test-only layer.",
    "Sixteen ordinary local managers promoted by flag or global binding after real context SQL; no factor or unproved factor, success/conflict intents, both POST/PATCH. Same bearer/SID recovers using real enrollment/TOTP or one-use recovery code, then full original DTO/storage/audit or409 followed by success.",
    "Four actual unique-index waits remove flag/global binding with MFA intact. Exact blocking owner observed and negative identity commit atomic with release. Only the externally committed competitor persists; command/audit remain unchanged.",
    "Sixteen narrow AFTER triggers run after actual organization write or audit; proof/factor/binding loss or exception. Sequence witness verifies one invocation even after rollback. All organizations, domain audits, proof and hashed full factor/recovery state, bindings/flag restored. Temporary owner functions have restricted search_path and public EXECUTE revoked; catalog restored.",
    "Earlier81 accepted cases remain separately evidenced and are not repeated or summed. Remaining domains, private cache, complete API/ingest and browser/native/hardware/operations acceptance remain pending. MFA068 candidate, main001-067 unchanged; no production or performance acceptance."
